    },
    "一期如实告知；后续可加一个进程内的随机握手令牌（需要电脑端配合）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We say so up front; a random in-process handshake token can be added later (it needs the computer side to cooperate)."
