    "原生 SwiftUI 界面，直接和电脑上的 DSH 说话：看时间线、发消息、批审批、看产物。不经过任何第三方服务器。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A native SwiftUI client that talks straight to DSH on your computer: read the timeline, send messages, approve actions, collect deliverables. No third-party server involved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
