    "已经能在你电脑上执行代码的人，可以伪造回环 Host 通过栅栏、自签配对码，把自己配成一台「手机」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anyone who can already run code on your computer can forge the loopback Host to pass the fence and mint their own pairing code, enrolling themselves as a “phone”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已经能在你电脑上执行代码的人，可以伪造回环请求、自签配对码，把自己配成一台「手机」。所以不要把本 App 用在你同时跑不可信代码的电脑上。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anyone who can already run code on your computer can forge loopback requests and mint their own pairing code, enrolling themselves as a “phone”. So don’t use this app on a computer where you also run untrusted code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
